# 0x2014 LOOT_ITEM -- server->client, variable length, name-bearing.
# Byte-identical structure to 0x2013 TRACTOR_ORE (the proxy/server reuse the
# same article-create layout for mined ore and looted drops).
#
# Source: live reference server, port 3573 (sector), cleartext
# proxy<->server UDP leg, KillLoot2 capture frame #91 (reassembled inner
# frame; see plans/33). Player 0x4003992A loots "Craxel Hide" from a killed
# enemy hulk.
#
# Decode (matches LootItemRecord):
#   @0  PlayerGID          0x4003992A
#   @4  article_UID        0x00254360
#   @8  article_effect_UID 0x0025435F
#   @12 resource_basset    1326         (0x052E)
#   @14 loot_tick          0x51515790
#   @18 nameLen            11
#   @20 name               "Craxel Hide"
#   @31 tractor_time       4500         (0x1194)
#   @35 tractor_speed      350.0
#   @39 position           x,y,z floats
2A 99 03 40 60 43 25 00 5F 43 25 00 2E 05 90 57 51 51 0B 00
43 72 61 78 65 6C 20 48 69 64 65 94 11 00 00 00 00 AF 43 0D
03 39 47 AA C6 7D C7 15 78 78 C5
